<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - HS Resources cut to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - HS Resources cut to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it downgraded HS Resources Inc to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- set a 12-month price target of $15-$16 a share.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
